### Prerequisites

- [X] I understand and accept the project's [code of conduct](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)
- [X] I have already [searched in existing issues](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3ABug) and found no previous report of this bug.

### Is your feature request related to a problem?

`.notification-counter` in files `admin\themes\new-theme\public\main.css` and `admin\themes\new-theme\public\theme.css` uses background `#f1b746` with white font color. This produces low conrast.

Darker color, e.g. orangered for background or black for text should be used to enhance readability.

See attached image with original bg and orangered as bg
![nimetön](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/15167679/160419460-bcbeb3e9-5707-4941-94a5-3ec9a6597811.jpg)

Original bg with black text gives even better contrast.

### Describe the solution you'd like

Contrast should be better for readability.
In `admin\themes\new-theme\public\main.css`, search for
```
.notification-counter{
   position:absolute;
   top:0.25rem;
   right:0;
   display:inline-block;
   padding:0 0.1875rem;
   font-size:0.625rem;
   line-height:0.75rem;
   color:#fff;
   background:#f1b746;
   border:0.125rem solid #fff;
   border-radius:1rem;
   top:-1.75rem;
   right:-0.9375rem
}
```

1. Change to:

```
.notification-counter{
   position:absolute;
   top:0.25rem;
   right:0;
   display:inline-block;
   padding:0 0.1875rem;
   font-size:0.625rem;
   line-height:0.75rem;
   color:#fff;
   background:#f1b746;
   border:0.125rem solid #fff;
   border-radius:1rem;
   top:-1.75rem;
   right:-0.9375rem; 
   color:black;
}
```
2. Or to:

```
.notification-counter{
   position:absolute;
   top:0.25rem;
   right:0;
   display:inline-block;
   padding:0 0.1875rem;
   font-size:0.625rem;
   line-height:0.75rem;
   color:#fff;
   background:#f1b746;
   border:0.125rem solid #fff;
   border-radius:1rem;
   top:-1.75rem;
   right:-0.9375rem; 
   color:black;
   font-weight:bold;
}
```

3. or some other bg / color combination that produces good contrast.

### Do you plan to work on this feature?

- [] I'm willing to contribute a [formal specification](https://github.com/PrestaShop/prestashop-specs).
- [X] I'm willing to provide any wireframes or design assets required for this feature.
- [ ] I'm willing to submit a Pull Request that implements this feature.
- [X] I'm willing to help verify that the implemented feature works as intended and produces no unintended side effects.
